ruby>万能<rp>(</rp><rt>ばんのう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ではない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Man is not as almighty as God.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">紙</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かみ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">纸</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"151205\"><ruby>紙<rp>(</rp><rt>かみ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>木<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>から<ruby>作<rp>(</rp><rt>つく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>られる。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Paper is made from wood.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">髪</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かみ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">头发</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"125930\"><ruby>長<rp>(</rp><rt>なが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>髪<rp>(</rp><rt>かみ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をした<ruby>女<rp>(</rp><rt>おんな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>子<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>会<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いました。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I saw a girl with long hair.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">噛み切る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かみきる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">咬断；啃穿</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"216713\">サメがその<ruby>男<rp>(</rp><rt>おとこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>足<rp